    "slug": "saturday-3pm-blackout-explained",
    "title": "Why the Saturday 3pm Kick-Off Isn't on TV in Britain (But Is Almost Everywhere Else)",
    "description": "The 3pm blackout is a British rule, not a football rule. Here is what UEFA Article 48 actually says, the exact hours it blocks, and why the same fixture is shown live in most other countries.",
    "category": "guides",
    "publishedAt": "2026-08-16",
